WEBVTT

00:06:29.899 --> 00:06:33.295
a kad America utiša svoj um,
otvara razne dimenzije

00:06:33.319 --> 00:06:34.646
i u toj tišini

00:06:34.670 --> 00:06:37.757
može slušati bilo što i bilo koga.

00:06:40.053 --> 00:06:44.552
Nitko joj nikad nije ponudio
tišinu i duboko promišljanje

00:06:44.576 --> 00:06:46.187
kao način da bude moćna.

00:06:47.443 --> 00:06:51.427
Prvo to odbacuje, ali uz
Stormino ohrabrenje

00:06:51.451 --> 00:06:52.601
to klikne

00:06:53.376 --> 00:06:55.737
pa America utiša svijet oko sebe

00:06:57.432 --> 00:07:00.488
i utone duboko u ranjivost.